5. Foreign Function & Memory API (Incubator)
Provides safe native interop without JNI. (Simplified conceptual example)


// Requires: --add-modules jdk.incubator.foreign --enable-preview (in 17)
import jdk.incubator.foreign.*;

public class MemDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try (MemorySegment segment =
                 MemorySegment.allocateNative(8, ResourceScope.newImplicitScope())) {
            segment.setAtIndex(ValueLayout.JAVA_LONG, 0, 42L);
            long value = segment.getAtIndex(ValueLayout.JAVA_LONG, 0);
            System.out.println(value);
        }
    }
}
Benefit: Performance + safety (bounds & lifetime) vs raw ByteBuffer or JNI.

6. Context-Specific Deserialization Filters
Set filters per stream to prevent insecure object graphs.


import java.io.*;
import java.util.*;

public class FilterDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        byte[] data = serialize(List.of("a","b"));
        try (var ois = new ObjectInputStream(new ByteArrayInputStream(data))) {
            // Allow only java.util.* classes
            ObjectInputFilter filter = ObjectInputFilter.Config.createFilter("maxdepth=5;java.util.*;!*");
            ois.setObjectInputFilter(filter);
            Object obj = ois.readObject();
            System.out.println(obj);
        }
    }
    static byte[] serialize(Object o) throws Exception {
        var baos = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
        try (var oos = new ObjectOutputStream(baos)) { oos.writeObject(o); }
        return baos.toByteArray();
    }
}
7. Security Manager Deprecated
If your app still sets a SecurityManager, plan a migration (e.g., use containerization, OS-level sandboxing, custom policy layers). Avoid new development depending on it.

8. Platform Ports & Performance
macOS/AArch64: Native build for Apple Silicon → faster startup, lower power.

New rendering pipeline (earlier JEP 382) + ongoing performance improvements.

9. Applet API Deprecated for Removal
Legacy browser plugin era is over. Remove any lingering applet code.

