✅ C. Putting Modern Java 17 Features Together

public sealed interface Event permits Click, Purchase { }

public record Click(String element, long timestamp) implements Event { }
public record Purchase(String sku, double amount) implements Event { }
public final class Unknown implements Event { }

public class EventHandler {
    public static String handle(Event e) {
        // (If using preview) switch pattern:
        return switch (e) {
            case Click c    -> "Click on " + c.element();
            case Purchase p -> "Purchase " + p.sku() + " amount=" + p.amount();
            case Unknown u  -> "Unknown event";
        };
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(handle(new Click("button#save", System.currentTimeMillis())));
        System.out.println(handle(new Purchase("BOOK-123", 19.99)));
        // text block
        String payload = """
                         {
                           "status": "ok"
                         }
                         """;
        System.out.println(payload);
    }
}
✅ D. Migration / Upgrade Tips (11 → 17)
Concern	What to Check	Tip
