Build Tool	Maven/Gradle toolchains	Set maven-toolchains-plugin or Gradle toolchain for Java 17
Preview Features	Need flags	Don’t ship preview to production unless policy allows
Security Manager Deprecated	Legacy sandboxing	Use containers, OS sandbox, custom classloaders
Performance Gains	G1, ZGC maturity	Benchmark; maybe enable ZGC for low-latency needs

✅ E. Choosing a GC in Java 17
GC	When to Use
G1 (default)	General purpose; balanced pause times
ZGC (-XX:+UseZGC)	Large heap (multi-GB), very low pauses
Shenandoah (-XX:+UseShenandoahGC, distro-specific)	Low-pause alternative (Red Hat builds)
Serial / Parallel	Small apps / throughput-only batch jobs

