📌 Summary (Java 17 Value Proposition)
Modern language constructs (records, sealed types, pattern matching, switch expressions) → expressive domain modeling.

Developer ergonomics (text blocks, helpful NPEs).

Performance & scaling (improved G1, ZGC maturity, new RNG).

Safer native interop path (Foreign Function & Memory API incubator).

Stronger encapsulation & security hardening (serialization filters, internal API lockdown).

Long-term stability (LTS) suitable for enterprise migration.

